    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tower Defense Battle for the Island!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An army of\u00a0zombie-like alien invaders has arrived, polluting the once-peaceful ocean world of the Crabby Fishes! As the leader of the resistance, build defenses, deploy powerful aquatic allies, and fight to reclaim your home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd80 <strong>Tactical Tower Defense</strong>\u00a0- strategically place defenders to stop waves of enemies<br>\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Unique Aquatic Units</strong> \u2013 command a team of quirky sea creatures, each with special abilities<br>\u267b\ufe0f <strong>Eco-Twist</strong> \u2013 battle pollution and clean up your ocean while fighting off foes<br>\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Dynamic Battles</strong> \u2013 face ever-changing threats with adaptable strategies<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Vibrant Hand-Drawn Art</strong> \u2013 a colorful and lively underwater world awaits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Hidden Treasures</strong> \u2013 explore levels to uncover secret items and bonuses that aid your defense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A</strong>re you ready to save the island?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tower Defense Battle for the Island!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An army of\u00a0zombie-like alien invaders has arrived, polluting the once-peaceful ocean world of the Crabby Fishes! As the leader of the resistance, build defenses, deploy powerful aquatic allies, and fight to reclaim your home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd80 <strong>Tactical Tower Defense</strong>\u00a0- strategically place defenders to stop waves of enemies<br>\ud83c\udf0a <strong>Unique Aquatic Units</strong> \u2013 command a team of quirky sea creatures, each with special abilities<br>\u267b\ufe0f <strong>Eco-Twist</strong> \u2013 battle pollution and clean up your ocean while fighting off foes<br>\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Dynamic Battles</strong> \u2013 face ever-changing threats with adaptable strategies<br>\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Vibrant Hand-Drawn Art</strong> \u2013 a colorful and lively underwater world awaits</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Hidden Treasures</strong> \u2013 explore levels to uncover secret items and bonuses that aid your defense</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A</strong>re you ready to save the island?</p>",
